      "start_seconds": 0.62,
      "end_seconds": 4.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Mm, sorry, doctor, shall I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.2,
      "end_seconds": 10.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 11.1,
      "end_seconds": 18.44,
      "duration_seconds": 7.34,
      "text": "Okay, so doctor, I'll sit in if that's okay, I know what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.17,
      "end_seconds": 22.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Please do. Extra information is always welcome."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 22.84,
      "end_seconds": 31.17,
      "duration_seconds": 8.33,
      "text": "doctor, um, it's been feeling like I have flu that's what we're worried about"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.52,
      "end_seconds": 35.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.11,
      "end_seconds": 38.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.15,
      "text": "Moderate, really"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.93,
      "end_seconds": 42.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "has there been nausea too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.17,
      "end_seconds": 54.72,
      "duration_seconds": 11.55,
      "text": "Yes, for ten days. Well, about nausea, about a a seven out of ten. I mean, I've been losing weight too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.82,
      "end_seconds": 63.23,
      "duration_seconds": 6.41,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any sore throat, cough, fever or diarrhoea?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.05,
      "end_seconds": 70.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "Erm, no, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.94,
      "end_seconds": 74.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.09,
      "end_seconds": 79.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "No, um, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.88,
      "end_seconds": 96.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.55,
      "end_seconds": 108.39,
      "duration_seconds": 10.84,
      "text": "Oh, it's Tiotropium inhaler, once a day for my chest. It's, It's Thyronorm, 50 micrograms, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.2,
      "end_seconds": 113.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.14,
      "end_seconds": 123.82,
      "duration_seconds": 8.68,
      "text": "COPD, for about a year. I've had an underactive thyroid for five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.31,
      "end_seconds": 126.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Any other things?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.17,
      "end_seconds": 136.46,
      "duration_seconds": 9.29,
      "text": "yes, COPD and an underactive thyroid are known to us, good to have that clear. Tell me about your eating"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.44,
      "end_seconds": 144.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.02,
      "end_seconds": 148.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.53,
      "end_seconds": 153.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.58,
      "end_seconds": 160.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Any inherited conditions that that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.14,
      "end_seconds": 165.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Um, my uncle has high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.91,
      "end_seconds": 181.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.39,
      "end_seconds": 190.18,
      "duration_seconds": 7.79,
      "text": "Years back I got stomach pain from naproxen, so I stay away from it now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.32,
      "end_seconds": 205.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.86,
      "end_seconds": 215.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.96,
      "end_seconds": 244.6,
      "duration_seconds": 7.64,
      "text": "okay: respiratory rate 17, temp 36.9 degrees, pressure 130 over 77, pulse is 111 beats a minute"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.16,
      "end_seconds": 249.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "right, let's have a proper look at you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.55,
      "end_seconds": 251.25,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "right"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.87,
      "end_seconds": 254.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.31,
      "end_seconds": 268.53,
      "duration_seconds": 6.22,
      "text": "you are breathing a little deeply and fast and your mouth is dry"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.66,
      "end_seconds": 272.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.81,
      "end_seconds": 292.67,
      "duration_seconds": 15.86,
      "text": "You can sit up now. Putting it all together, the most likely explanation is possible new type 1 diabetes starting to turn acidic. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 293.43,
      "end_seconds": 295.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.11,
      "end_seconds": 327.72,
      "duration_seconds": 30.61,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's possible new type 1 diabetes starting to turn acidic, and we'll know more once the a finger-prick glucose and ketones is back. I'm sending you for a finger-prick glucose and ketones because of thirst and weight loss. This is not flu, your sugar is very high, and you need hospital insulin today. If the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.48,
      "end_seconds": 335.54,
      "duration_seconds": 7.06,
      "text": "let's review you straight away right, that's the plan do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 336.68,
      "end_seconds": 341.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "Right, um, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 347.35,
      "end_seconds": 348.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "have a good day"
    }
  ]
